    {"kind":"sign","x":3,"y":23,"text":["A board by the brook: \"Stonebrook Reservoir. Stonebrook Timber Co.\"","Under it, newer, in a careful hand: \"The water goes out and comes back. Mind which. A. Brandt, keeper.\""]},
    {"kind":"sign","x":10,"y":20,"text":["A brass plate set in the dam: \"Stonebrook Timber Co. The brook held here to drive the mill.\"","Scratched under it, long ago: \"And the farms under it. And her.\""]},
    {"kind":"sign","x":18,"y":7,"text":["Painted on a board, in a careful hand: \"When she goes quiet, come back. The water is a minute behind. A. Brandt, keeper.\""]},
